    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the Master AI Router for an E-commerce AI Operating System.\nYou ONLY classify the event and choose ONE specialized agent. Never invent data.\n\nAllowed agents (exactly one):\n- revenue_recovery\n- customer_intent\n- delivery_exception\n- inventory_rescue\n- returns_intelligence\n- winback\n\nEvent:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.event) }}\n\nContext summary:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.context) }}\n\nReturn STRICT JSON only (no markdown, no explanation):\n{\n  \"agent\": \"one_of_allowed\",\n  \"priority\": \"low|medium|high|critical\",\n  \"reason\": \"short explanation\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0\n}\n\nRouting rules:\n- abandoned_checkout → revenue_recovery\n- customer_message → customer_intent\n- order_delayed OR fulfillment_exception → delivery_exception\n- inventory_low → inventory_rescue\n- return_requested → returns_intelligence\n- customer_inactive → winback\n- Anything else or low confidence → choose the closest safe agent or set agent to \"unsupported\""
      },
      "id": "8f816493-b05d-434d-9096-c2f1e02e7305",
      "name": "AI Router (Classify)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        -816,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nlet text = item.text || item.output || item.response || JSON.stringify(item);\n\n// Clean markdown fences if present\ntext = String(text).replace(/```json\\n?/gi, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '').trim();\n\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(text);\n} catch (e) {\n  // Retry repair attempt would go here in full version; fallback\n  parsed = {\n    agent: 'unsupported',\n    priority: 'medium',\n    reason: 'AI output parse failed — fallback to human review',\n    confidence: 0.1\n  };\n}\n\nconst allowed = ['revenue_recovery','customer_intent','delivery_exception','inventory_rescue','returns_intelligence','winback'];\nif (!allowed.includes(parsed.agent)) {\n  parsed.agent = 'unsupported';\n  parsed.reason = (parsed.reason || '') + ' | Invalid agent name';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...($('Collect Context (Shopify-ready)').first().json),\n    routing: parsed\n  }\n}];"
      },
